# Copy to .env.local only if you need to override the package scripts; the scripts already set these for
# local development and tests. Never commit real values.

# Local and test database driver: "pglite" (embedded Postgres). On Vercel the driver is always Neon.
DB_DRIVER=pglite
# PGlite data directory: a folder path for dev, or memory:// for tests.
PGLITE_DIR=.pglite

# Production only. Set by the Neon integration from the Vercel Marketplace; never paste it by hand.
# DATABASE_URL=

# Users API secrets. Generate each with `openssl rand -hex 32`, keep it in a password manager and add it in the
# Vercel dashboard (Production and Preview). Tests use fixed fake values from vitest.config.ts.
# ADMIN_TOKEN=     Bearer token for GET /users and admin PATCH; never sent to the browser.
# SESSION_SECRET=  HMAC key for the 30-minute self-service profile cookie.
# POSTHOG_PROJECT_KEY= PostHog project key (phc_...), server-only, set in Vercel. Never NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# ANALYTICS_SINK=log   Optional: keep events local (E2E, Lighthouse) instead of sending them to PostHog.
# `pnpm dev` sets local-only placeholders for ADMIN_TOKEN and SESSION_SECRET and ANALYTICS_SINK=log unless you
# export your own; they are visible in package.json and are never used on Vercel, where the real values are required.
